{"seq":2,"slug":"mitigation-voluntary-correction","title":"从轻减轻情节与海关裁量基准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-audit-smuggling-enforcement/administrative-violation/mitigation-voluntary-correction","wordCount":2641,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"从轻减轻情节与海关裁量基准\">从轻减轻情节与海关裁量基准</h1><p>罚款幅度在法条里是一个区间：漏缴税款 30% 以上 2 倍以下。区间的最左与最右相差六倍以上，落在哪里不由「海关心情」决定，而由一套公开的裁量规则决定。《行政处罚法》与海关裁量基准共同构成这套规则：前者规定哪些情节<strong>应当</strong>从轻减轻，后者把抽象情节换算成具体的罚款百分比。</p>\n<p>企业在被处罚时能做的实质工作，就是在这套规则里找到适用于自己的阶次，并用证据把情节固定下来。说情不产生法律效果，情节与证据产生。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>裁量不是印象分，是一套可从条文推导出具体金额的规则，理解它要抓住四个概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>「应当」与「可以」的分野</strong>：符合「应当」情形时行政机关没有裁量空间，必须从轻或减轻；「可以」留有裁量空间，需要用证据和理由去争取。</li>\n<li><strong>情节必须已成书面事实</strong>：「主动消除或减轻危害后果」「认错认罚」「立功」都有形式要求，补税凭证、制度发布记录、举报线索经查证属实才是证据，承诺不是。</li>\n<li><strong>阶次换算公式</strong>：从轻区间上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A + (B-A) \\times 30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span>，一般区间到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B - (B-A) \\times 50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span>，从重到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>，区间由法定最低额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 与最高额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 直接算出。</li>\n<li><strong>主动披露是跳阶通道</strong>：它不是普通从轻情节，而是符合条件直接到「不予处罚」、不符合至少落在「应当从轻或减轻」的独立机制。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这四个概念合起来给出一条操作顺序：先看有没有「应当」情节可主张，再检查有没有从重情形会抵消，最后把每项主张映射到条文与已发生的书面证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"行政处罚法的三条基础规则\">行政处罚法的三条基础规则</h2><p>《行政处罚法》给出了三组基础规定，全部海关处罚都建立在其上（<a href=\"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/中华人民共和国行政处罚法_(2021年)\">中华人民共和国行政处罚法</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三组基础规则的分工\">三组基础规则的分工</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>条文</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>举证责任</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第三十二条</td>\n<td>「应当」从轻或减轻</td>\n<td>强制适用，无裁量空间</td>\n<td>企业证明情节存在</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三十三条</td>\n<td>不予行政处罚</td>\n<td>轻微/首违可/无过错</td>\n<td>无主观过错由企业举证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三十六条</td>\n<td>追责时效</td>\n<td>二年（特殊五年）</td>\n<td>起算自行为发生或终了之日</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"第三十二条-应当从轻或减轻\">第三十二条：应当从轻或减轻</h3><p>条文列举五类<strong>应当</strong>从轻或者减轻处罚的情形：主动消除或者减轻违法行为危害后果的；受他人胁迫或者诱骗实施违法行为的；主动供述行政机关尚未掌握的违法行为的；配合行政机关查处违法行为有立功表现的；法律、法规、规章规定其他应当从轻或者减轻行政处罚的。</p>\n<p>注意「应当」二字——符合这些情形时行政机关没有裁量空间，必须从轻或减轻。其中「主动消除或者减轻违法行为危害后果」是企业在稽查中最容易满足的一条：补税、改正、建立防复发机制都属于「消除或减轻危害后果」，前提是这些动作发生并被记录。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第三十三条-不予行政处罚\">第三十三条：不予行政处罚</h3><p>三类不予处罚的情形：违法行为轻微并及时改正，没有造成危害后果的；初次违法且危害后果轻微并及时改正的，<strong>可以</strong>不予处罚；当事人有证据足以证明没有主观过错的。</p>\n<p>第二类与第三类都带限定词。「初次违法不罚」用的是「可以」，属于裁量而非强制；「无主观过错不罚」虽然表述为不予处罚，但要由当事人举证，且法律、行政法规另有规定的从其规定。对关务场景来说，「无主观过错」的举证通常落在「企业已建立并执行了合理的审查制度，错误源于第三方提供的不实资料」这一路径上——这也是内控体系存在的另一重价值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"第三十六条-追责时效\">第三十六条：追责时效</h3><p>违法行为在二年内未被发现的，不再给予行政处罚；涉及公民生命健康安全、金融安全且有危害后果的，延长至五年。起算自违法行为发生之日，行为有连续或继续状态的，自行为终了之日起算。</p>\n<p>把三条规则合成一张判断表：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;base_rules&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;art32_mandatory&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;tiers&quot;: [&quot;从轻&quot;, &quot;减轻&quot;],&#10;      &quot;effect&quot;: &quot;应当（无裁量空间）&quot;,&#10;      &quot;conditions&quot;: [&quot;主动消除或减轻危害后果&quot;, &quot;受胁迫或诱骗&quot;, &quot;主动供述尚未掌握的违法行为&quot;, &quot;配合查处有立功表现&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;art33_no_penalty&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;mandatory&quot;: [&quot;轻微且及时改正未造成危害后果&quot;, &quot;有证据证明无主观过错&quot;],&#10;      &quot;discretionary&quot;: [&quot;初次违法且危害后果轻微并及时改正（可以）&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;art36_limitation&quot;: { &quot;years&quot;: 2, &quot;extended_years&quot;: 5, &quot;start&quot;: &quot;行为发生之日；连续或继续状态自终了之日起算&quot; }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"base_rules\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"art32_mandatory\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"tiers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"从轻\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"减轻\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"effect\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"应当（无裁量空间）\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"conditions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"主动消除或减轻危害后果\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"受胁迫或诱骗\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"主动供述尚未掌握的违法行为\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"配合查处有立功表现\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"art33_no_penalty\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"mandatory\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"轻微且及时改正未造成危害后果\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"有证据证明无主观过错\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"discretionary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"初次违法且危害后果轻微并及时改正（可以）\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"art36_limitation\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"years\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"extended_years\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"start\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"行为发生之日；连续或继续状态自终了之日起算\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"海关裁量基准的五阶次体系\">海关裁量基准的五阶次体系</h2><p>海关总署公告 2025 年第 21 号公布的《海关行政处罚裁量基准（二）》把裁量阶次明确为五种：不予行政处罚、减轻行政处罚、从轻行政处罚、一般行政处罚以及从重行政处罚；无特别情形的，适用一般处罚（<a href=\"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202502/content_7062904.htm\">关于修订《中华人民共和国海关行政处罚裁量基准（二）》的公告</a>）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"罚款幅度的换算公式\">罚款幅度的换算公式</h3><p>基准第十三条给出把阶次换算成具体金额的公式。以法定最低罚款额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>、法定最高罚款额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶次</th>\n<th>罚款下限</th>\n<th>罚款上限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>从轻</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>（含本数）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A + (B-A) \\times 30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span>（不含本数）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一般</td>\n<td>从轻上限（含本数）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B - (B-A) \\times 50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span>（不含本数）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>从重</td>\n<td>一般上限（含本数）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span>（含本数）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>若罚则只规定最高罚款倍数、比例或数额，则最低额按零计算。这个规则直接适用于第十五条第四档：漏缴税款 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A = 0.3T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = 2T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，从轻区间上界为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.3</mn><mi>T</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1.7</mn><mi>T</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.81</mn><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.3T + 1.7T \\times 30\\% = 0.81T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.7</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.81</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;tier_calc&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;inputs&quot;: { &quot;A&quot;: &quot;法定最低罚款额（无规定时为0）&quot;, &quot;B&quot;: &quot;法定最高罚款额&quot; },&#10;    &quot;bands&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;light&quot;: { &quot;min&quot;: &quot;A&quot;, &quot;max&quot;: &quot;A+(B-A)*0.30&quot;, &quot;max_inclusive&quot;: false },&#10;      &quot;normal&quot;: { &quot;min&quot;: &quot;A+(B-A)*0.30&quot;, &quot;max&quot;: &quot;B-(B-A)*0.50&quot;, &quot;max_inclusive&quot;: false },&#10;      &quot;heavy&quot;: { &quot;min&quot;: &quot;B-(B-A)*0.50&quot;, &quot;max&quot;: &quot;B&quot;, &quot;max_inclusive&quot;: true }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;example_art15_item4&quot;: { &quot;A&quot;: &quot;0.3*T&quot;, &quot;B&quot;: &quot;2*T&quot;, &quot;light_upper&quot;: &quot;0.81*T&quot; }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tier_calc\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"inputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"法定最低罚款额（无规定时为0）\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"法定最高罚款额\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"bands\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"light\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A+(B-A)*0.30\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_inclusive\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"normal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"A+(B-A)*0.30\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B-(B-A)*0.50\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_inclusive\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"heavy\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"min\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B-(B-A)*0.50\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"max_inclusive\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"example_art15_item4\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"A\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0.3*T\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2*T\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"light_upper\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"0.81*T\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"应当与可以从轻的情节\">应当与可以从轻的情节</h3><p>基准第八条列举<strong>应当</strong>从轻或减轻的情节：已满十四周岁不满十八周岁的未成年人；主动消除或减轻违法后果；受他人胁迫或诱骗；主动供述海关尚未掌握的违法行为；配合查处并有立功表现。第九条列举<strong>可以</strong>从轻或减轻的情节：尚未完全丧失辨认或控制能力的精神病人、智力残疾人；积极配合查处且认错认罚；违法危害后果较轻。</p>\n<p>两条的分野决定企业的应对姿态：争取落在第八条的「主动消除或减轻违法后果」是强制从轻，只做到「积极配合、认错认罚」只能落入第九条的裁量从轻。</p>\n<h3 id=\"从重情形与过罚相当\">从重情形与过罚相当</h3><p>第十条列举从重情形：损害国家对外贸易关系或声誉、造成疫情疫病或安全事故、暴力威胁或伪造销毁证据、拒绝调查整改、一年内同类再犯、突发事件中违反应对措施等。第三条与第五条确立过罚相当原则：处罚应与违法事实、性质、情节及社会危害程度相当。第十四条对术语作了界定：认错认罚须<strong>书面</strong>表示；配合查处包括提供协助、担保或按要求进行技术处理、销毁、退运、检疫处理等；立功表现须检举线索并经查证属实——这几条把「态度」变成了可留痕的书面动作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"主动披露在裁量体系中的位置\">主动披露在裁量体系中的位置</h2><p>主动披露的从轻减轻有独立的法律依据。稽查条例第二十六条规定，企业主动报告违反海关监管规定行为并接受处理的，<strong>应当</strong>从轻或者减轻行政处罚（<a href=\"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/中华人民共和国海关稽查条例\">中华人民共和国海关稽查条例</a>）；实施办法第二十七条进一步规定，违法行为轻微并及时纠正、未造成危害后果的不予行政处罚，主动披露并补缴税款的可以减免滞纳金。</p>\n<p>把它放进裁量体系可以看清它的层级：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[发现申报差异] --&gt; B{是否已收到稽查通知}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[评估主动披露适用性]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D[走一般处罚程序]&#10;  C --&gt;|符合免罚条件| E[不予行政处罚]&#10;  C --&gt;|不符合免罚但认定为披露| F[应当从轻或减轻]&#10;  D --&gt; G{法定情节}&#10;  G --&gt;|主动补税/消除后果| H[应当从轻或减轻]&#10;  G --&gt;|积极配合认错认罚| I[可以从轻或减轻]&#10;  G --&gt;|无从轻情节| J[一般处罚]&#10;  G --&gt;|有从重情节| K[从重处罚]\">graph TD\n  A[发现申报差异] --&gt; B{是否已收到稽查通知}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[评估主动披露适用性]\n  B --&gt;|是| D[走一般处罚程序]\n  C --&gt;|符合免罚条件| E[不予行政处罚]\n  C --&gt;|不符合免罚但认定为披露| F[应当从轻或减轻]\n  D --&gt; G{法定情节}\n  G --&gt;|主动补税/消除后果| H[应当从轻或减轻]\n  G --&gt;|积极配合认错认罚| I[可以从轻或减轻]\n  G --&gt;|无从轻情节| J[一般处罚]\n  G --&gt;|有从重情节| K[从重处罚]</pre><p>主动披露的价值在于它是<strong>跳过一个阶次</strong>的通道：符合免罚条件的直接到「不予处罚」，不符合的至少落在「应当从轻或减轻」。这两个结果都优于在一般处罚程序里争取「可以从轻」。主动披露的具体适用条件与除外情形见 <a href=\"../voluntary-disclosure-control/voluntary-disclosure-penalty-immunity\">主动披露制度与免罚减罚适用</a>。</p>\n<p>需要注意的是，主动披露的免罚并不意味着罚款之外的其他后果自动消失。税款本身仍要补缴，滞纳金可以申请减免但要经海关认定，而涉及许可证件管理与禁止性管理的部分不在免罚范围内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把情节变成证据-一份可执行的裁量主张\">把情节变成证据：一份可执行的裁量主张</h2><p>裁量主张不是申请信，而是一组材料。每一项主张都必须映射到基准条文与支撑证据，否则不产生效果。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;mitigation_claim&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;case_ref&quot;: &quot;&lt;稽查结论或处罚告知书编号&gt;&quot;,&#10;    &quot;claims&quot;: [&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;eliminate_consequences&quot;,&#10;        &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;行政处罚法第三十二条 / 裁量基准第八条&quot;,&#10;        &quot;trigger&quot;: &quot;从轻或减轻（应当）&quot;,&#10;        &quot;evidence&quot;: [&quot;补税缴款书&quot;, &quot;主数据纠正记录&quot;, &quot;防复发制度发布记录&quot;]&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;voluntary_disclosure&quot;,&#10;        &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;海关稽查条例第二十六条&quot;,&#10;        &quot;trigger&quot;: &quot;从轻或减轻（应当）&quot;,&#10;        &quot;evidence&quot;: [&quot;主动披露报告表&quot;, &quot;自查报告&quot;, &quot;整改完成证明&quot;]&#10;      },&#10;      {&#10;        &quot;type&quot;: &quot;cooperate_and_accept&quot;,&#10;        &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;裁量基准第九条&quot;,&#10;        &quot;trigger&quot;: &quot;从轻或减轻（可以）&quot;,&#10;        &quot;evidence&quot;: [&quot;书面认错认罚材料&quot;, &quot;配合记录&quot;]&#10;      }&#10;    ],&#10;    &quot;excluded&quot;: [{ &quot;type&quot;: &quot;repeat_within_1y&quot;, &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;裁量基准第十条 / 实施条例第五十三条&quot; }]&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mitigation_claim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"case_ref\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;稽查结论或处罚告知书编号>\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"claims\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"eliminate_consequences\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"行政处罚法第三十二条 / 裁量基准第八条\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"从轻或减轻（应当）\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"补税缴款书\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"主数据纠正记录\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"防复发制度发布记录\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"voluntary_disclosure\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"海关稽查条例第二十六条\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"从轻或减轻（应当）\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"主动披露报告表\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"自查报告\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"整改完成证明\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cooperate_and_accept\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"裁量基准第九条\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"trigger\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"从轻或减轻（可以）\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"evidence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"书面认错认罚材料\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"配合记录\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"excluded\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"repeat_within_1y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"裁量基准第十条 / 实施条例第五十三条\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份工件的设计要点有三条。第一，<code>trigger</code> 字段区分「应当」与「可以」，企业应优先主张落在「应当」栏的情节，因为那不需要说服裁量者。第二，<code>evidence</code> 必须是<strong>已发生的书面事实</strong>，而不是承诺；「我们将加强管理」不是证据，「已于某日发布某制度并完成全员培训」才是。第三，<code>excluded</code> 字段要主动检查有没有从重情形——一年内同类再犯会直接抵消从轻主张，如 <a href=\"inaccurate-declaration-violation\">申报不实与违规行为构成</a> 所述，这个时间窗是处罚之后的一整年。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>裁量不是黑箱，是一套可以从条文推导出具体金额的机械规则，企业的任务是让自己落进更有利的阶次。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>「应当」与「可以」的分野决定是否需要说服</strong>：前者符合即强制适用，后者留有裁量空间。</li>\n<li><strong>主动消除或减轻危害后果是最容易满足的强制从轻情节</strong>，补税与改正都必须留下书面记录。</li>\n<li><strong>裁量基准给出换算公式</strong>：从轻上限为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>30</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A + (B-A) \\times 30\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">30%</span></span></span></span></span>，一般区间到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>×</mo><mn>50</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B - (B-A) \\times 50\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50%</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>主动披露是被处罚之前跳阶的通道</strong>，符合条件直接不予处罚，不符合至少落在应当从轻。</li>\n<li><strong>认错认罚与立功都有形式要求</strong>，前者须书面表示、后者须检举线索经查证属实。</li>\n<li><strong>从重情形会抵消从轻主张</strong>，一年内同类再犯与拒绝调查整改是最常见的两项。</li>\n<li><strong>裁量主张是一组材料而非一封信</strong>，每项主张须映射到具体条文与已发生的书面证据。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"从轻减轻情节与海关裁量基准","id":"从轻减轻情节与海关裁量基准"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"行政处罚法的三条基础规则","id":"行政处罚法的三条基础规则"},{"level":3,"text":"三组基础规则的分工","id":"三组基础规则的分工"},{"level":3,"text":"第三十二条：应当从轻或减轻","id":"第三十二条-应当从轻或减轻"},{"level":3,"text":"第三十三条：不予行政处罚","id":"第三十三条-不予行政处罚"},{"level":3,"text":"第三十六条：追责时效","id":"第三十六条-追责时效"},{"level":2,"text":"海关裁量基准的五阶次体系","id":"海关裁量基准的五阶次体系"},{"level":3,"text":"罚款幅度的换算公式","id":"罚款幅度的换算公式"},{"level":3,"text":"应当与可以从轻的情节","id":"应当与可以从轻的情节"},{"level":3,"text":"从重情形与过罚相当","id":"从重情形与过罚相当"},{"level":2,"text":"主动披露在裁量体系中的位置","id":"主动披露在裁量体系中的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"把情节变成证据：一份可执行的裁量主张","id":"把情节变成证据-一份可执行的裁量主张"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"申报不实的构成与罚则五档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-audit-smuggling-enforcement/administrative-violation/inaccurate-declaration-violation"},"next":{"title":"海关信用、预警与布控联动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-audit-smuggling-enforcement/administrative-violation/customs-warning-control-target"}}